252
00:13:17,080 --> 00:13:17,510
And kind of a joke almost.

253
00:13:18,080 --> 00:13:20,170
So the phrase, it's not you, it's me, it's one of them.

254
00:13:20,760 --> 00:13:21,760
Yeah.

255
00:13:21,760 --> 00:13:23,600
And she also said you deserve better.

256
00:13:23,600 --> 00:13:24,500
You deserve someone better.

257
00:13:24,840 --> 00:13:25,840
Yeah.

258
00:13:25,840 --> 00:13:28,020
That's a very common one saying like, I'm not good enough for you.

259
00:13:28,200 --> 00:13:28,340
Yeah.

260
00:13:29,200 --> 00:13:31,280
But again, it kind of just, it loses its meaning, doesn't it?

261
00:13:32,160 --> 00:13:37,600
And also another phrase that's very cliche, but it wasn't in our dialogue was maybe the timing is just not right.

262
00:13:37,920 --> 00:13:38,920
Yeah.

263
00:13:38,920 --> 00:13:39,380
People say that all the time.

264
00:13:39,920 --> 00:13:40,920
Yeah.

265
00:13:40,920 --> 00:13:41,920
So they say, no, the timing is not right.

266
00:13:41,920 --> 00:13:43,800
It's not the appropriate time to be together.

267
00:13:44,080 --> 00:13:45,080
Yeah.

268
00:13:45,080 --> 00:13:48,760
That's just an excuse for not wanting to date that special person.

269
00:13:49,360 --> 00:13:50,360
Exactly.

270
00:13:50,360 --> 00:13:55,940
So it can be a difficult situation and people do it every day through letters, sometimes through the phone.

271
00:13:55,940 --> 00:13:56,940
Yeah.

272
00:13:56,940 --> 00:13:58,720
And sometimes it's just breaking up in person.

273
00:13:58,720 --> 00:14:04,680
So listeners, why don't you tell us if you have any stories of breaking up with someone or maybe somebody broke up with you.

274
00:14:04,680 --> 00:14:05,680
That's right.

275
00:14:05,680 --> 00:14:12,560
Try and use the language in this lesson and visit us on our website at EnglishPod.com and leave us a comment.

276
00:14:12,560 --> 00:14:13,100
All right.

277
00:14:13,560 --> 00:14:15,380
We'll see you guys there and until next time.

278
00:14:15,600 --> 00:14:16,600
Thanks for listening and goodbye.

279
